OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds take part in UK Rubik's
OL,4,ACube championship
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of the fastest people to solve
OL,7,Fa Rubik's Cube in the country have been
OL,8,Ftaking part in the national
OL,9,Fchampionships in Birmingham.
OL,11,FThe event featured a range of different
OL,12,Fevents between Friday and Sunday,
OL,13,Fincluding the standard 3x3 puzzle, as
OL,14,Fwell as other cube sizes from 2x2 all
OL,15,Fthe way up to 7x7.
OL,17,FSome competitors were also trying for
OL,18,Fthe fastest time in challenges, such as
OL,19,Fcompleting the standard cube with one
OL,20,Fhand and blindfolded in the
OL,21,Fchampionship at the University of
OL,22,FBirmingham's Sport & Fitness Centre.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
