OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds take part in UK Rubik's
OL,4,ACube championship
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Rubik's Cube, a 3D puzzle solved by
OL,7,Ftwisting, was invented by Erno Rubik in
OL,8,F1974 and at least 350 million have been
OL,9,Fsold worldwide.
